; Lazy emission against eager emission over the streams of the other cirgen
; tests (virtual functions and thunks, virtual bases and construction
; vtables, static locals, comdat groups, exceptions, member pointers, RTTI,
; structors, retracted and dropped definitions): at -O0 and -O2 the assembly
; is byte for byte the same, and the exit status agrees (a deferred body that
; is never replayed may hide an emitter-only error: lazy succeeds where eager
; fails, never the other way round).  More than ten of the streams defer a
; body.
; RUN: %python %scripts/lazy_identity_tests.py %S %ecil-asm %edg-cir %t.d
